Ranjit Bauri, IIT Madras. Powder Metallurgy, NPTEL 113106098. [Official course](https://nptel.ac.in/courses/113106098) · [Complete twelve-week syllabus](https://archive.nptel.ac.in/content/syllabus_pdf/113106098.pdf).

Complete the public sequence and work its examples: powder production/atomization, structure, particle/surface characterization, packing/mixing, compaction, slurry methods, solid/liquid-phase sintering, and full-density methods. Connect processing history and atmosphere with final microstructure, defects, and properties.

Official instructor identity, full syllabus, and public topic sequence were verified on 29 October 2026. Preserve actual run/version and media/component notices. The indexed lecture grouping and syllabus week numbering are not assumed identical across runs; assign named topics. Public reading is distinct from certification and permission to redistribute. No source files or external powder data are bundled.

